ADDITIONAL NOTICE — EDUCATIONAL USE ONLY

This project intentionally contains INSECURE cloud configurations for learning
and defensive practice. The default path runs entirely locally and free
(LocalStack, minikube) with no cloud account. If you adapt any of it to a real
cloud account, you are responsible for the resources and costs you create, and
you must only do so in an account you own or are explicitly authorized to use.
Never deploy these misconfigurations to a production or shared environment.
